    "Name": "J.Edgar (XP)",
    "Details": "ComStar's strange fanaticism once drove the Order to erase the original name and design engineer of the JunEdgar Light Hover Tank, along with the tank's production numbers, from the historical record, because the kanji character used for her first name meant ''Purity.'' The adherents believed that this belittled Jerome Blake, the galaxy's only true embodiment of purity in their view.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 11/17 hexes / 330/510 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     15\n<b>Left</b>         110     15\n<b>Right</b>       110     15\n<b>Rear</b>         80     15\n<b>Turret</b>      130     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      585     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Laser</color>",
    "Icon": "J.edgar"
  },
